// EXPECTED: compile error
// expect-error: cannot use @bitcast
// @bitcast ALWAYS lowers to a memcpy statement-expression, never a constant cast,
// so it can't be a file-scope initializer. The checker accepted it and GCC then
// rejected the emitted C ("braced-group within expression..."). (2026-08-09.)
const u32 FBITS = @bitcast(u32, (f32)1.5);
u32 main() { if (FBITS != 0x3FC00000) { return 1; } return 0; }
